    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80612" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενιχρ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>poor, needy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.348
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				165
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				181
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
				4.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				7.19
			</span></i>.—Poet. word, found in Com., as <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				976
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philetaer.
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diod.
			</span></i> Com.<i><span class="en">
				2.8
			</span></i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				578a
			</span></i>, and in later Prose, as <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.73
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Socr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				3.13.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				22.25
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δίαιτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					p.48
				</span></i>
			
			<u>J.</u>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενιχρότερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.284
				</span></i>
			, 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.21.7
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-χρῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1252b3
				</span></i>
			. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ</span> by nature, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i> cc., also <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				2.416
			</span></i>, elsewh. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span> by
			position.]</div>
